# Implementation plan — Spec 1.14.0

## Summary

Keep WebOnOne **`/login`**. Load Identity **`/login?parentOrigin=…`** in an **iframe**. On success, Identity **`postMessage`s** `webonone:auth:success` (JWT + user); WebOnOne stores the session and navigates home. **No** top-level redirect to Identity. Retain `/callback` auth-code exchange for redirect consumers.

See [02-webonone-login-iframe-host.md](./02-webonone-login-iframe-host.md), [03-identity-embed-login.md](./03-identity-embed-login.md), [04-auth-postmessage-contract.md](./04-auth-postmessage-contract.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.14.0` |
| Prerequisite | Identity login/register APIs; WebOnOne auth slice + `/callback`; peer iframe pattern; theme channel A |
| Services | WebOnOne FE, Identity FE; optional `packages/platform-embed` |
| New env | None required (`VITE_IDENTITY_ORIGIN`, `VITE_ALLOWED_PARENT_ORIGINS` already exist) |

