## Phase 1 — Contract helpers

**Goal:** Shared auth message types / sender.

**Exit criteria:** Both FEs can import or mirror `webonone:auth:success` safely.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Types + guards | `packages/platform-embed/src/types.ts` and/or `webonone-v2/.../embed.types.ts` |
| Optional sender | `packages/platform-embed/src/embedUrl.ts` or `sendAuthSuccess.ts` |

**Verify:** build/type-check platform-embed if changed

---

## Phase 2 — Identity embed success

**Goal:** postMessage on login when `parentOrigin` set; skip redirect completion.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Embed branch | `identity/frontend/src/features/auth/pages/LoginPage.tsx` |
| Query preserve | `redirectQuery.ts` / embed query helper |
| Skip redirect | Do not call `completeAuthRedirect` in embed mode |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w identity-root`

---

## Phase 3 — WebOnOne host

**Goal:** `/login` iframe + listener; remove `location.assign`.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| LoginPage | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/auth/pages/LoginPage.tsx` |
| Frame + hook | `features/auth/components/IdentityLoginFrame.tsx` (new) |
| Config URL | `identityConfig.ts` / embed URL builder |
| Theme on load | postMessage `webonone:theme:apply` into iframe |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root`

