## Forbidden

- Top-level redirect from WebOnOne `/login` as primary path
- Local WebOnOne credential forms
- JWT in URL
- Removing `/callback` or auth-code APIs
- `postMessage('*')`
- Using authenticated `PlatformServiceFrame` for guest login

